    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law and the insurance law, in relation to requiring health maintenance organizations to cover court ordered health care services",
    "basePrintNo": "S4922",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4922-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
